MsgEn:
It looks like Chief Alchemist 
Diamantes is undertaking a major study; 
I wonder what will unfold.

I can sense the weakening vitality 
of the forest and the land; 
Lestania is faltering.

The gold of the Golden Country does not 
come from the land; 
it is gold born from nothingness.

Whate'er the accursed Dragon's intent,
if Prince Nedo be fit to bear its strength,
one path alone shall be before him.

I consider myself the captain's right-hand man;
No matter who comes back or leaves,
That will never change.

--Hey, just between you and me;
I wonder if Prince Nedo can fight because he's
already an "Arisen"?

Arisen, I had you take a look at it the other day;
It's an "old well under a lighthouse",
You see the sealed door at the back?

Welcome to Tel.
Let us help you prepare for your journey;
How can we help you?

There are no signs of movement so far, but
if they start to approach the village,
there is sure to be trouble.

The <VAL EMNAME> were a bit of a distraction
from my search at <VAL SPOT>,
so I killed about <VAL> of them, Master.

Master, I went to search 《<VAL SPOT>》;
It was dangerous.
But you see, I have a treasure as a souvenir.
